From: DiaxuDev <diaxudev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:14:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix: remove doubled memset from chroma_init causing
 previously set state fields to reset

---
 src/core.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/core.c b/src/core.c
index 697d8ea..32bf7c8 100644
--- a/src/core.c
+++ b/src/core.c
@@ -18,8 +18,6 @@ int chroma_init(chroma_state_t *state) {
     return CHROMA_ERROR_INIT;
   }
 
-  // Initialize all fields to zero
-  memset(state, 0, sizeof(chroma_state_t));
   state->ipc_fd = -1;
 
   // Set initial state
